+## 2026-07-19 — PS-03D5-4 Accepted with Deferred Corrections
+
+PS-03D5-4 — Update and Status Override Backend, Runtime Disabled is accepted with deferred corrections.
+
+### Deferred corrections (MUST FIX BEFORE PS-03D7 MUTATION ACTIVATION)
+
+- Online ID case-preservation and case-insensitive advisory-lock normalization: the current implementation stores Online ID as entered but compares duplicates case-insensitively using SQL `LOWER()`. The deferred correction is to apply the same case-insensitive normalization to the PostgreSQL advisory-lock tokens used during duplicate detection, so identical Online IDs in different cases cannot race past each other.
